    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW21kRXq9R8f9BL3eSYVrQpsh)_\n\nFollow-up to #278.\n\n- **Keymap design** (`docs/architecture/global-keymap-namespaces.org`): GUI Emacs only (terminal support left for later); the leader root is now `C-z`, because Cmd+Space (Alfred) and Ctrl+Space (input-source switch) rule out every `SPC` root, including today's `C-x C-SPC`; `pop-global-mark` goes to `C-z b m`; shims live until Sia removes them; Python rows and steps dropped.\n- **Python removed**: `sp-python.el` and its doc, `ein` from `sp-prog-misc` (code and doc), the `conditional-loading.org` line. Left alone: `ob-python` in `sp-org-babel` and the Python used by `sp-litdb` (an external tool, not a Python-mode setup).\n- **Evil removed**: `sp-evil.el` and its doc, the commented module entries (`init.el`, `sp-config-profiles.el`, `conditional-loading.org`), the Evil hooks in `sp-windows`, `sp-dashboard`, `sp-helper-funct` (the `[escape]` block; `minibuffer-keyboard-quit` stays, now unbound) and `sp-org-taskman-extra`, plus the matching doc blocks and the README row. Last commit with Evil: [4164bae](https://github.com/siainbuletin/dotfiles/tree/4164baced7367fac684a3c90bd66c8f537be70e6). Not touched: historical notes in `docs/tangles/org-config.org`, theme docs and `docs/leftovers/`.\n- CHANGELOG line added.\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container); the `tangle` check is the test for the `.el`/doc match.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9sdrKxJ3CH27TGGqB)_",
